#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:5
#: 84984a9181ec43409e9555b9fa4fc849
msgid "Camera Triggering using Seagull MAP2"
msgstr "使用 Seagull MAP2 触发相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:10
#: d4782ef75b434f35b79bb9aa9bd68a61
msgid ""
"This article shows how connect and configure the `Seagull MAP2 "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map2/>`__ so that ArduPilot can "
"trigger a camera shutter from the pilot's transmitter or during :ref:`camera"
" missions <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`.  "
"More detailed instructions are provided in the `Seagull MAP2 Manual "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_MAP2-Manual.pdf>`__ and `Seagull"
" MAP2 product support page <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-"
"map2-support>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何连接和配置 `Seagull MAP2 <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-"
"map2/>`__，以便 ArduPilot 可通过飞手遥控器或在 :ref:`相机任务 <common-camera-control-and-"
"auto-missions-in-mission-planner>` 期间触发相机快门。详细说明见 `Seagull MAP2 Manual "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/manuals/Seagull_MAP2-Manual.pdf>`__ 和 `Seagull "
"MAP2 product support page <https://www.seagulluav.com/seagull-"
"map2-support>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:13
#: d135e799d8e840c2936e5df1fa152f18
msgid ""
"The list of supported cameras can be found `here on Seagull UAVs Cable "
"Finder page <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-finder/>`__"
msgstr ""
"支持的相机列表可在 `Seagull UAV 数据线查找页面 <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-"
"finder/>`__ 找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:15
#: 69d64291287c4e55a73b8a8c40ed7098
msgid ""
"The board supports two trigger modes which are determined by the servo PWM "
"output set in the :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration <common-camera-shutter-"
"with-servo>` in Mission Planner:"
msgstr ""
"该板支持两种触发模式，由 Mission Planner 的 :ref:`相机快门配置 <common-camera-shutter-with-"
"servo>` 中设置的舵机 PWM 输出值决定："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:17
#: 11c7f76dd81e4c18b16af5cd05d3c2b6
msgid "**AF-T** (\"AutoFocus-Trigger\") : 1 second pre-focus followed by trigger"
msgstr "**AF-T** （「AutoFocus-Trigger」）：先预对焦 1 秒，然后触发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:18
#: 4d917e38e4eb4ebba97025e2af9845a4
msgid ""
"**IS-T** (\"Instant-Trigger\") : instant trigger as soon as camera locks "
"focus"
msgstr "**IS-T** （「Instant-Trigger」）：相机锁定焦点后立即触发"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:20
#: af364d02b32843ae9a4a53eafcc8dced
msgid ""
"If used with Sony \"Multi\" cameras, Seagull MAP2 also supports turning the "
"camera on or off  using \"Do-Set-Servo\" or \"Do-Repeat-Servo\" commands"
msgstr ""
"如与 Sony 「Multi」相机配合使用，Seagull MAP2 还支持通过「Do-Set-Servo」或「Do-Repeat-"
"Servo」命令开关相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:24
#: a512beb2abb54d25b006392027aedeee
msgid ""
"The board also supports triggering from the RC transmitter (this is not "
"covered in this article, but is demonstrated in the manual)."
msgstr "该板还支持从遥控器触发（本文未涉及，但手册中有演示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:28
#: ae2c1af00c6348bfa961cabb64f43443
msgid "Parts and hardware connections"
msgstr "零件和硬件连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:30
#: c8e1f0244e0f40a587d897e1bf83c15f
msgid ""
"The Seagull MAP2 can be `purchased from Seagull UAV "
"<https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-map2/>`__ and comes with a servo"
" cable included. The camera cables has to be purchased separately - please "
"use the `Cable Finder <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-cable-finder/>`__ page"
" to determine which cable is needed."
msgstr ""
"Seagull MAP2 可从 `Seagull UAV <https://www.seagulluav.com/product/seagull-"
"map2/>`__ 购买，附带舵机连接线。相机数据线需另购——请使用 `数据线查找 <https://www.seagulluav.com/map-"
"cable-finder/>`__ 页面确定所需数据线。"

