#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:45
#: e5b0d2e4b6a6476688deb470be6dbbb2
msgid ""
"The 3-pin servo connector should be connected to the autopilot's rear servor"
" rail.  You can connect to any of Pixhawk's usable AUX ports, as discussed "
"in :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>`."
msgstr ""
"3 针舵机连接线应连接到飞控后部舵机轨道。可连接到 Pixhawk 任意可用的 AUX 端口，详见 :ref:`Camera Shutter "
"Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:47
#: 18a38ea1a80a4f3cae61cc0c6e65aa3d
msgid ""
"On the opposite side of the MAP2, is a 2.5mm jack for connecting the cable "
"for your specific camera."
msgstr "MAP2 的另一侧是一个 2.5mm 插孔，用于连接特定相机的数据线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:51
#: 8908ca9b23de4b66b95bc38ff4bb8aa6
msgid ""
"MAP2 is powered by Pixhawk's power rail (the middle pin +). Ensure that the "
"rail is powered by BEC or other power source ranging from 3.5-5.5 Volts in "
"order for MAP2 to function properly."
msgstr ""
"MAP2 由 Pixhawk 电源轨（中间引脚 +）供电。请确保电源轨通过 BEC 或其他 3.5-5.5V 电源供电，以使 MAP2 正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:56
#: e230ce2231f94ec6b6d0d74de62b1db8
msgid "Camera shutter configuration in Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 中的相机快门配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:58
