"``Shutter (Port)``: Depends on the connected output - e.g. RC10 for AUX2."
msgstr "``Shutter (Port)``：取决于连接的输出——例如 AUX2 对应 RC10。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:69
#: ef1862630ee44fdbbf6a38bfc43baec8
