#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:72
#: 4ac9823703484d6eb05925603f01504b
msgid "``IS-T``: 1700 μS (1600 to 1800 μS)."
msgstr "``IS-T``：1700 μS（1600 至 1800 μS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:74
#: f8bbcbd0d58742fe8ff964afb1f6d5cc
msgid "``Shutter Not Pushed``: 1500us (1400 to 1600 μS)."
msgstr "``Shutter Not Pushed``：1500us（1400 至 1600 μS）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-seagull-map2.rst:75
#: 481d986c4b0c4dd1b5bdc958775b1c61
msgid ""
"``Shutter Duration``: Set the value **\"1\"** for AF-T mode or **\"10\"** "
"for IS-T mode."
msgstr "``Shutter Duration``：AF-T 模式设为 **「1」**，IS-T 模式设为 **「10」**。"

